& [Delineation]
  + cryptographic signature verification proves payload integrity and possession of a policy-pinned key
  + supplied policy governance publisher identity trust onboarding production key custody and supported delivery are distinct external authorities
  + synthetic public fixture verification proves mechanics only and can never become production publisher authenticity

& [SevenFold]
  + [fold_1_identity] exact policy payload bundle evidence source target and key identities are explicit and closed
  + [fold_2_bytes] bounded physical bytes are rehashed locally and the canonical signed payload has one deterministic representation
  + [fold_3_authority] verification receipt has exhaustive false governance delivery installation secret and effect fields
  + [fold_4_faults] malformed unknown mismatched tampered aliased and symlink inputs refuse before a verified receipt
  + [fold_5_cleanup] evidence fixtures are public temporary files with exact cleanup and no production material
  + [fold_6_growth] one separate dependency-free workspace crate is the smallest implementation surface and existing release binaries remain unchanged
  + [fold_7_boundary] signing commands key lifecycle trust onboarding installer extraction service provider remote effect FPGA and Minecraft are pruned

& [DataDesign]
  + ReleasePublisherPolicy owns use status policy and publisher identities verifying key allowed release profile allowed target and nonauthority
  + ReleaseSignaturePayload owns exact policy publisher release source target bundle evidence and authority-boundary identities
  + SignedReleaseEnvelope owns payload plus one Ed25519 signature
  + ReleaseSignatureReceipt owns verified public identities and exhaustive nonclaims without raw input or path retention

& [Rollback]
  + remove the separate crate fixture evidence docs and governance; portable bundle bootstrap and all existing runtime binaries remain unchanged
